  {
   "rating": -6,
   "date": "2005-01-01T17:29:23-06:00",
   "body": "XP for completion was 1450, not 2500.\n\nCoastrunners are at the northern end of the beach.\n\nWarriors are mixed in with most of the Murlocs along the entire length of the coast.\n\nOracles are to the south.\n\nTidehunters are in the far south with Oracles.\n\nThe final turn-in is at the Westfall Lighthouse which is at the far south of the beach.  After killing your Tidehunters just keep running south and you can't miss it.",
   "replies": [
    "i thought exp was relative to your level and the level of the quest."
   ]
  }
 ]
